OL,3,GNEWSASheep stolen from Clarkson's
OL,4,ADiddly Squat Farm
OL,5,
OL,6,FEleven sheep have been stolen from
OL,7,FDiddly Squat Farm belonging to
OL,8,Fpresenter Jeremy Clarkson.
OL,10,FThames Valley Police said it received
OL,11,Freports on Wednesday that the animals
OL,12,Fhad been taken from the farm in
OL,13,FChadlington, Oxfordshire, within the
OL,14,Flast 10 days.
OL,16,FIt said officers spoke with Clarkson at
OL,17,Fthe scene on Thursday, adding that no
OL,18,Farrests had been made and anyone with
OL,19,Finformation should get in contact.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
